msgid "GDPR, articles 33 and 34"
msgstr ""

#: src/PageHelp.php:516
msgid ""
"The internal audit programme: scope, dates, auditors, report and findings."
msgstr ""

#: src/PageHelp.php:520
msgid ""
"Plan the year's audits, enter the report and the findings; each "
"nonconformity opens an action plan."
msgstr ""

#: src/PageHelp.php:524
msgid "ISO 27001, 9.2"
msgstr ""

#: src/PageHelp.php:529
msgid ""
"The internal audit programme over the certification cycle: which ISMS "
"process is audited which year, and which one is not covered yet."
msgstr ""

#: src/PageHelp.php:534
msgid ""
"Make sure every process is audited at least once over the cycle: plan an "
"audit for each process in red or orange, and choose its processes in the "
"\"Programme and independence\" tab of the audit."
msgstr ""

